Subject: [PATCH 6/6] Drop brain.cpp's unused audio device include

brain.cpp included spiralcore/audio.h, and with it PortAudio, without
using either. Building the brain without an audio device no longer needs
PortAudio's headers.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 brain/src/brain.cpp | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/brain/src/brain.cpp b/brain/src/brain.cpp
index 3b31732..d5d50db 100644
--- a/brain/src/brain.cpp
+++ b/brain/src/brain.cpp
@@ -18,7 +18,6 @@
 #include <algorithm>
 #include <sndfile.h>
 #include <float.h>
-#include <spiralcore/audio.h>
 #include "brain.h"
 #include "status.h"
 
